Ftiffin-mark.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></span></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-7 lg:flex\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"group relative py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-bottom-0.5 after:h-px after:origin-left after:bg-forest-700 after:transition-transform after:duration-300 text-stone-600 after:scale-x-0 hover:text-forest-800 hover:after:scale-x-100\" href=\"/rooms\">Rooms</a><a class=\"group relative py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-bottom-0.5 after:h-px after:origin-left after:bg-forest-700 after:transition-transform after:duration-300 text-stone-600 after:scale-x-0 hover:text-forest-800 hover:after:scale-x-100\" href=\"/restaurant\">Restaurant</a><a class=\"group relative py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-bottom-0.5 after:h-px after:origin-left after:bg-forest-700 after:transition-transform after:duration-300 text-forest-800 after:scale-x-0\" href=\"/tours\">Experiences<span class=\"absolute inset-x-0 -bottom-0.5 h-px bg-forest-700\"></span></a><a class=\"group relative py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-bottom-0.5 after:h-px after:origin-left after:bg-forest-700 after:transition-transform after:duration-300 text-stone-600 after:scale-x-0 hover:text-forest-800 hover:after:scale-x-100\" href=\"/story\">Our story</a><a class=\"group relative py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-bottom-0.5 after:h-px after:origin-left after:bg-forest-700 after:transition-transform after:duration-300 text-stone-600 after:scale-x-0 hover:text-forest-800 hover:after:scale-x-100\" href=\"/location\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"flex items-center justify-self-end gap-2\"><div tabindex=\"0\"><a class=\"btn-primary hidden !px-5 !py-3 sm:flex\" href=\"/rooms\">Book a stay <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div><button class=\"icon-control grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-forest-950/15 text-forest-950 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-forest-700 hover:bg-forest-700 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-4 focus-visible:ring-forest-600/15 lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main><section class=\"border-b border-white/10 bg-forest-950 text-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-28\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#d49a75]\">Tours and activities</p><h1 class=\"mt-5 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.045em] sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl\">Let Sauraha set the pace.</h1><p class=\"mt-7 max-w-2xl text-[17px] font-normal leading-8 text-forest-100/70\">Days here can begin in the jungle, drift along the river and end with the sunset. Tell us what interests you and we’ll help with the next step.</p></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"grid gap-8 border-b border-stone-300 pb-12 lg:grid-cols-[.75fr_1.25fr] lg:items-end\"><h2 class=\"max-w-xl text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.04em] text-forest-950 sm:text-5xl\">Choose a direction, not an itinerary.</h2><div class=\"max-w-2xl lg:justify-self-end\"><p class=\"text-base leading-8 text-stone-600\">Activities are arranged by enquiry rather than booked or paid online. What is available can depend on the day and season.</p><a href=\"#experience-enquiry\" class=\"link-action mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-forest-800 hover:text-forest-600\">Tell us what interests you <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7 7 10 10\"></path><path d=\"M17 7v10H7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 space-y-20 lg:mt-24 lg:space-y-28\"><article class=\"grid gap-9 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center lg:gap-14\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden bg-stone-200 lg:col-span-7  rounded-[1.5rem_6rem_1.5rem_1.5rem]\"><div class=\"aspect-[16/10]\"><img alt=\"A jeep safari moving through the forest in Chitwan\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Fjungle-safari.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Fjungle-safari.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Fjungle-safari.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Fjungle-safari.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Fjungle-safari.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Fjungle-safari.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Fjungle-safari.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Fjungle-safari.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Fjungle-safari.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Fjungle-safari.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Fjungle-safari.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-start-9 lg:col-span-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#a75536]\">Forest</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em] text-forest-950 sm:text-4xl\">Into the jungle</h3><p class=\"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-stone-600\">Jeep safaris, jungle walks and wildlife experiences around Chitwan National Park.</p><div class=\"mt-7 border-y border-stone-300 py-2\"><p class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 last:border-b-0\">Chitwan National Park jungle safari</p><p class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 last:border-b-0\">Jeep safari</p><p class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 last:border-b-0\">Jungle walk</p><p class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 last:border-b-0\">Wildlife experiences</p></div></div></article><article class=\"grid gap-9 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center lg:gap-14\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden bg-stone-200 lg:col-span-7 lg:order-2 rounded-[6rem_1.5rem_1.5rem_1.5rem]\"><div class=\"aspect-[16/10]\"><img alt=\"A wooden canoe crossing the Rapti River at sunset\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Frapti-canoe.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Frapti-canoe.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Frapti-canoe.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Frapti-canoe.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Frapti-canoe.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Frapti-canoe.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Frapti-canoe.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Frapti-canoe.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Frapti-canoe.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Frapti-canoe.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Frapti-canoe.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"lg:order-1 lg:col-start-2 lg:col-span-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#a75536]\">River</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em] text-forest-950 sm:text-4xl\">Along the river</h3><p class=\"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-stone-600\">Canoeing, bird watching and time beside the Rapti River at sunset.</p><div class=\"mt-7 border-y border-stone-300 py-2\"><p class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 last:border-b-0\">Canoeing</p><p class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 last:border-b-0\">Bird watching</p><p class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 last:border-b-0\">Rapti River and sunset activities</p></div></div></article><article class=\"grid gap-9 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center lg:gap-14\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden bg-stone-200 lg:col-span-7  rounded-[1.5rem_1.5rem_6rem_1.5rem]\"><div class=\"aspect-[16/10]\"><img alt=\"Traditional homes and a quiet courtyard in a Tharu village\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Ftharu-village.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Ftharu-village.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Ftharu-village.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Ftharu-village.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Ftharu-village.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Ftharu-village.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Ftharu-village.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Ftharu-village.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Ftharu-village.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Ftharu-village.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexperiences%2Ftharu-village.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-start-9 lg:col-span-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#a75536]\">Community</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em] text-forest-950 sm:text-4xl\">Local life</h3><p class=\"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-stone-600\">Village tours, Tharu cultural experiences and nature sightseeing around Sauraha.</p><div class=\"mt-7 border-y border-stone-300 py-2\"><p class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 last:border-b-0\">Tharu cultural experiences</p><p class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 last:border-b-0\">Village and cultural tours</p><p class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 last:border-b-0\">Nature and sightseeing around Sauraha</p></div></div></article></div></section><section id=\"experience-enquiry\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 bg-[#efe6d7]\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[90rem] gap-14 px-5 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr] lg:px-10 lg:py-28\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#a75536]\">Make an enquiry</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-0.04em] text-forest-950 sm:text-5xl\">What would you like to experience?</h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md text-base leading-8 text-stone-600\">Share your dates and interests. We’ll reply with the available options. No payment is collected through this form.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[1.5rem_4rem_1.5rem_1.5rem] border border-stone-300/80 bg-white p-6 sm:p-9 lg:p-12\"><form class=\"grid gap-7\"><div class=\"grid gap-7 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><label for=\"tour-fullName\" class=\"!mb-0 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500\">Your name</label><input class=\"w-full !rounded-none !border-x-0 !border-t-0 !border-stone-300 !bg-transparent !px-0 !py-3 text-[15px] !shadow-none focus:!border-forest-700 focus:!ring-0\" id=\"tour-fullName\" autoComplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"Full name\" required=\"\" name=\"fullName\"/></div><div><label for=\"tour-email\" class=\"!mb-0 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500\">Email address</label><input class=\"w-full !rounded-none !border-x-0 !border-t-0 !border-stone-300 !bg-transparent !px-0 !py-3 text-[15px] !shadow-none focus:!border-forest-700 focus:!ring-0\" id=\"tour-email\" type=\"email\" autoComplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" required=\"\" name=\"email\"/></div></div><div><label for=\"tour-phone\" class=\"!mb-0 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500\">Phone or WhatsApp <span class=\"font-normal text-stone-400\">(optional)</span></label><input class=\"w-full !rounded-none !border-x-0 !border-t-0 !border-stone-300 !bg-transparent !px-0 !py-3 text-[15px] !shadow-none focus:!border-forest-700 focus:!ring-0\" id=\"tour-phone\" type=\"tel\" autoComplete=\"tel\" placeholder=\"Include your country code\" name=\"phone\"/></div><div><label for=\"activityInterest\" class=\"!mb-0 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500\">What interests you?</label><select class=\"w-full !rounded-none !border-x-0 !border-t-0 !border-stone-300 !bg-transparent !px-0 !py-3 text-[15px] !shadow-none focus:!border-forest-700 focus:!ring-0\" id=\"activityInterest\" name=\"activityInterest\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Select an experience</option><option>Jeep or jungle safari</option><option>Canoeing and bird watching</option><option>Tharu village and cultural tour</option><option>Rapti River sunset</option><option>Something else</option></select></div><fieldset><legend class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar-days text-[#a75536]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v3\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 9h18\"></path><path d=\"M8 13h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 13h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 13h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 17h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 17h.01\"></path></svg> Preferred dates <span class=\"font-normal text-stone-400\">(optional)</span></legend><div class=\"mt-2 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><label for=\"preferredStart\" class=\"sr-only\">Preferred start date</label><input class=\"w-full !rounded-none !border-x-0 !border-t-0 !border-stone-300 !bg-transparent !px-0 !py-3 text-[15px] !shadow-none focus:!border-forest-700 focus:!ring-0\" id=\"preferredStart\" type=\"date\" name=\"preferredStart\"/></div><div><label for=\"preferredEnd\" class=\"sr-only\">Preferred end date</label><input class=\"w-full !rounded-none !border-x-0 !border-t-0 !border-stone-300 !bg-transparent !px-0 !py-3 text-[15px] !shadow-none focus:!border-forest-700 focus:!ring-0\" id=\"preferredEnd\" type=\"date\" name=\"preferredEnd\"/></div></div></fieldset><div><label for=\"tour-message\" class=\"!mb-2 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500\">Tell us a little more</label><textarea class=\"w-full resize-none !rounded-[1.25rem] !border-stone-200 !bg-[#fbf8f1] !px-4 !py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 focus:!border-forest-600 focus:!ring-4 focus:!ring-forest-600/10\" id=\"tour-message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Who is travelling, and what kind of day are you hoping for?\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><p class=\"flex max-w-xs items-start gap-2 text-xs leading-5 text-stone-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-forest-700\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>This is an enquiry only. No payment is collected here.</p><button class=\"btn-primary shrink-0\" type=\"submit\" tabindex=\"0\">Send enquiry<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></form></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"overflow-hidden bg-forest-950 text-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-14 lg:px-10 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 border-b border-white/10 pb-14 lg:grid-cols-[.65fr_1.35fr] lg:items-end lg:pb-16\"><a aria-label=\"Tiffin Home and Restaurant, home page\" class=\"group w-fit\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"relative block h-20 w-20 sm:h-24 sm:w-24\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain brightness-0 invert transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:rotate-[-3deg] group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"96px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url